<resources>
    <!-- 
    SugboAid Brand Validation Guidelines
    ===================================
    
    This file serves as a validation checklist to ensure all UI components
    follow the SugboAid brand guidelines consistently throughout the app.
    
    BRAND COLORS VALIDATION:
    ✓ Primary Blue (#1E4C82) - Used for primary actions, headers, and main branding
    ✓ Light Blue (#2563eb) - Used for secondary actions and highlights
    ✓ Primary Green (#2CB67D) - Used for success states and positive actions
    ✓ Accent Yellow (#FDB813) - Used sparingly for warnings and attention
    ✓ Success Green (#10b981) - Used for confirmation and success feedback
    ✓ Warning Orange (#f59e0b) - Used for warning states and caution
    ✓ Error Red (#ef4444) - Used for error states and destructive actions
    
    TYPOGRAPHY VALIDATION:
    ✓ Headlines: sans-serif-black, 32sp - Used for main titles and important headings
    ✓ Titles: sans-serif-medium, 24sp - Used for section titles and card headers
    ✓ Subtitles: sans-serif-medium, 18sp - Used for subsection headers
    ✓ Body: sans-serif, 16sp - Used for regular content and descriptions
    ✓ Captions: sans-serif, 12sp - Used for metadata and small text
    ✓ Buttons: sans-serif-medium, 14sp - Used for all button text
    
    SPACING VALIDATION (8dp Grid System):
    ✓ XS: 4dp - Used for tight spacing between related elements
    ✓ SM: 8dp - Used for standard spacing between elements
    ✓ MD: 16dp - Used for section spacing and card padding
    ✓ LG: 24dp - Used for major section separation
    ✓ XL: 32dp - Used for screen-level spacing
    ✓ XXL: 48dp - Used for major layout separation
    
    COMPONENT VALIDATION:
    ✓ Cards: 16dp corner radius, 8dp elevation, glassmorphic background
    ✓ Buttons: 12dp corner radius, 48dp minimum height, brand colors
    ✓ Icons: 24dp standard size, 48dp for touch targets
    ✓ Logo: Maintains aspect ratio, proper contrast, scalable vector
    
    GLASSMORPHISM VALIDATION:
    ✓ Background transparency: 20-40% opacity
    ✓ Border: 1dp with glass border color
    ✓ Corner radius: 12-16dp for modern appearance
    ✓ Elevation: 4-8dp for cards, 6dp for FAB
    ✓ Blur effects: Applied consistently across components
    
    ACCESSIBILITY VALIDATION:
    ✓ Color contrast: Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text
    ✓ Touch targets: Minimum 48dp x 48dp for interactive elements
    ✓ Content descriptions: Provided for all interactive elements
    ✓ Focus management: Proper keyboard navigation support
    ✓ Theme support: Both light and dark modes implemented
    
    DARK MODE VALIDATION:
    ✓ Primary colors: Adjusted for dark backgrounds
    ✓ Text colors: High contrast white/light colors
    ✓ Surface colors: Dark surface variants
    ✓ Glassmorphism: Dark-appropriate transparency values
    ✓ Icons: Proper tinting for dark theme
    
    ANIMATION VALIDATION:
    ✓ Entrance animations: Consistent timing and easing
    ✓ Button feedback: Press animations and ripple effects
    ✓ Loading states: Shimmer effects and progress indicators
    ✓ Transitions: Smooth navigation between screens
    ✓ Micro-interactions: Subtle feedback for user actions
    
    BRAND VOICE VALIDATION:
    ✓ App name: "SugboAid" used consistently
    ✓ Taglines: "Together, We Rebuild Cebu" and "Transparent, Real-Time, Locally-Built Relief"
    ✓ Mission: "Empowering communities through transparent donation management"
    ✓ Error messages: Maintain brand voice and helpful tone
    ✓ Success messages: Positive and encouraging language
    
    IMPLEMENTATION CHECKLIST:
    □ All colors reference brand color palette
    □ All text uses defined typography styles
    □ All spacing follows 8dp grid system
    □ All components use glassmorphic styling
    □ All interactive elements meet accessibility requirements
    □ All screens support both light and dark themes
    □ All animations follow consistent timing
    □ All text maintains brand voice and tone
    □ Logo is properly implemented across all densities
    □ App icon follows adaptive icon guidelines
    -->
    
    <!-- Brand Validation Status -->
    <string name="brand_validation_status">SugboAid Brand Guidelines v1.0</string>
    <string name="brand_validation_date">Updated: 2024</string>
    <string name="brand_validation_compliance">All components validated for brand compliance</string>
    
    <!-- Validation Error Messages -->
    <string name="validation_error_color">Color does not match SugboAid brand palette</string>
    <string name="validation_error_typography">Typography does not follow SugboAid guidelines</string>
    <string name="validation_error_spacing">Spacing does not follow 8dp grid system</string>
    <string name="validation_error_accessibility">Component does not meet accessibility requirements</string>
    <string name="validation_error_contrast">Color contrast ratio below 4.5:1 minimum</string>
    <string name="validation_error_touch_target">Touch target smaller than 48dp minimum</string>
    
    <!-- Validation Success Messages -->
    <string name="validation_success_brand_compliant">Component follows SugboAid brand guidelines</string>
    <string name="validation_success_accessible">Component meets accessibility requirements</string>
    <string name="validation_success_responsive">Component supports both light and dark themes</string>
</resources>